flowchart TD
    Start([Executor::perform_uop]) --> Action{action}
    Action -->|copy| Copy[Resolve source and write destination]
    Action -->|alu| ALU[Resolve operands; execute configured expression or program; write result and optional flags]
    Action -->|mem_read| Read[Resolve address; read memory or MMIO; write destination]
    Action -->|mem_write| Write[Resolve address and data; write memory or MMIO]
    Action -->|port_read / port_write| Port[Read or write separate port space]
    Action -->|coproc_read / coproc_write| Coproc[Read or write coprocessor register]
    Action -->|branch| Branch[Evaluate condition; if true set PC and mark it modified]
    Action -->|halt| Halt[Set halted flag]
    Read & Write --> Memory[Memory checks access and dispatches mapped MMIO]
    Memory --> Hooks[Peripheral read or write hook]
